The `pgformat` package targets output similar to darold/pgFormatter
(https://github.com/darold/pgFormatter) for stable snapshots without Perl.

pgFormatter is Copyright 2012–2026 Gilles Darold, PostgreSQL License
(https://github.com/darold/pgFormatter). The keyword and built-in function
lists in `keywords.go` and `funcs.go` are modelled on pgFormatter; no
pgFormatter source code is copied. The layout engine is an independent Go
implementation.

